# Login page — Option 3 (saved baseline)

When the user says **ارجع للخيار 3** / **restore option 3** / **خيار رقم 3**, restore from:

`docs/login-options/option-3/`

## What Option 3 is

Flagship split login ("Mill Gate"):
- Desktop: left visual panel + right form
- `LoginForgeScene` (rebar SVG, furnace, FD watermark)
- FD monogram badge (not above Sign in title)
- Marketing copy: gate→weighbridge headline, heroSupport, ambient module strip
- No FD kicker above the form "Sign in" heading

## Restore steps

1. Copy `page.tsx` → `src/app/(auth)/login/page.tsx`
2. Copy `login-forge-scene.tsx` → `src/components/auth/login-forge-scene.tsx`
3. In `src/app/globals.css`:
   - Replace the `:root` Auth/Login token block with `login-tokens.css`
   - Replace the Auth/Login component+keyframes block (Flagship Mill Gate through before ERP Utility Classes) with `login-styles.css`
4. Merge keys from `i18n-login-keys.json` into `messages/en.json` and `messages/ar.json` (`brand.tagline`, `brand.heroSupport`, `brand.monogram`, `auth.subtitle`, `auth.ambient`)

Do not invent a different design when restoring Option 3 — use the snapshot files.
